            "text": "<p><strong>My City Stands Together</strong> is more than a brand...it is a declaration of unity. </p><p>We are building a network of community leaders, organizations, and influential voices dedicated to showing pride in where they come from while giving back to the causes that matter.</p><p>We are looking for <strong>Ambassadors</strong> and <strong>Organizational Partners</strong> who share our vision. Whether you are a non-profit looking to fundraise, a business leader rallying your community, or a creator with a voice that people trust, we want to stand with you.</p><p></p><h3><strong>PROGRAM BENEFITS</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Earn & Give:</strong> Competitive commission rates on every sale generated through your unique code/link.</li><li><strong>Zero Inventory:</strong> We handle 100% of printing, fulfillment, and customer service.</li><li><strong>Exclusive Access:</strong> Early access to new city drops and limited-edition designs.</li><li><strong>Co-Branding Opportunities:</strong> (For select Organizational Partners) Opportunities for custom collaboration.</li></ul>"
